Backlog tail, Selected item/items:
I am interested in making the frontent baseclass responsible for all activities that belong in onconnect / disconnectedCallback methods.
the subclasses would declare things, and then the baseclass' onconnect / ondisconnect would work on the declarations by iteration

lets look at what the methods do today, to see how feasible it is. pull up all fronend files - and see what their onconnect and disconnectedCallback methods actually do. can we generalize and tuck away in baseclass, leaving subclasses nice and declarative? 


